{"authored" [] "sources" [{"question" "q-274979" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "A quadratic equation with real coefficients has a root ${x}_{1}=-2-10\\text{i}.$ What is the other root? **Use $i$ to denote the imaginary unit.**\n\n${x}_{2}=$\n{{field-1}}" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13977623/state.json" "file_sha256" "b3c080a6ff42aca4bb5dbba2287e3fb4ebe009721ba3a2f1ef790fd5c0bca930"} {"question" "q-274979" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "We're given that the quadratic equation has real coefficients and that ${x}_{1}=-2-10\\text{i}$ is a root. Therefore, its complex conjugate ${x}_{2}=-2+10\\text{i}$ is also a root." "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13977623/state.json" "file_sha256" "b3c080a6ff42aca4bb5dbba2287e3fb4ebe009721ba3a2f1ef790fd5c0bca930"} {"question" "q-274979" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13977623/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "6abedbd615512b719ea8cf60c57c1be5709c60e61b06e8ccc841cea1a2337307"} {"question" "q-274979" "field" "field-1" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/blank "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13977623/state.json" "file_sha256" "b3c080a6ff42aca4bb5dbba2287e3fb4ebe009721ba3a2f1ef790fd5c0bca930"} {"question" "q-274979" "field" "field-1" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "-2+10i"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13977623/state.json" "file_sha256" "b3c080a6ff42aca4bb5dbba2287e3fb4ebe009721ba3a2f1ef790fd5c0bca930"} {"question" "q-28519" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "A quadratic equation with real coefficients has a root $x=\\frac{-2+7\\text{i}}{2}.$ What is the other root?" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13977623/state.json" "file_sha256" "b3c080a6ff42aca4bb5dbba2287e3fb4ebe009721ba3a2f1ef790fd5c0bca930"} {"question" "q-28519" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "We're given that the quadratic equation has real coefficients and that $x=\\frac{-2+7\\text{i}}{2}=-1+\\frac{7}{2}\\text{i}$ is a root. Therefore, its complex conjugate $x=-1-\\frac{7}{2}\\text{i}=\\frac{-2-7\\text{i}}{2}$ is also a root." "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13977623/state.json" "file_sha256" "b3c080a6ff42aca4bb5dbba2287e3fb4ebe009721ba3a2f1ef790fd5c0bca930"} {"question" "q-28519" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/moderate "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13977623/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "6abedbd615512b719ea8cf60c57c1be5709c60e61b06e8ccc841cea1a2337307"} {"question" "q-28519" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13977623/state.json" "file_sha256" "b3c080a6ff42aca4bb5dbba2287e3fb4ebe009721ba3a2f1ef790fd5c0bca930"} {"question" "q-28519" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "\\frac{-2-7\\text{i}}{-2}"] ["math" "\\frac{-2-7\\text{i}}{2}"] ["math" "\\frac{-7+2\\text{i}}{2}"] ["math" "\\frac{-7-2\\text{i}}{2}"] ["math" "\\frac{2-7\\text{i}}{2}"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13977623/state.json" "file_sha256" "b3c080a6ff42aca4bb5dbba2287e3fb4ebe009721ba3a2f1ef790fd5c0bca930"} {"question"